# Tactical-genome screen arm (log 2026-09-08): the standing base with
# prio 1 -- the longest-reaching engageable target opens the first
# kill group, so the artillery topping every Impossible death ledger
# dies before the tanks screening it, at the measured risk of pulling
# the army deeper. Every other line is byte-identical to the base.
